{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18107641","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18107641","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1810764101:1":{"text":"お……思い出した……","source_cn":"我……我的记忆……我想起来了……<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5900424F14BBB7DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1810764102:0":{"text":"あぁ……兄さんっ！","source_cn":"呜呜呜……巴登！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F10982E36DB6F70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810764103:0":{"text":"……本当に、思い出したんだな。","source_cn":"……想起来就好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A366B7C91645427","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1810764104:0":{"text":"ほら、セリス……一族の当主がいつまでも泣きべそをかいてちゃだめじゃないか。","source_cn":"好啦，爱丝……你现在可是家主，不能再哭鼻子了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC722CB5E5E53E1E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1810764105:0":{"text":"それにセインも。顔をしかめてないで、少しは喜んでくれよ。","source_cn":"还有瑟恩，你不应该更高兴吗？笑一笑吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E99B3573A7E021D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1810764106:0":{"text":"……無理に笑わなくてもいい。","source_cn":"……你不必这样强颜欢笑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44DE5247598FF46A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1810764107:0":{"text":"……","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1810764108:0":{"text":"ムン婆のことは……本当にすまなかった。だが私は、ああするしかなかったのだ。","source_cn":"穆婆婆的事……对不起。那是我必须做的选择。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE085D1BA5F959F3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1810764109:1":{"text":"……ああ、分かっているよ。","source_cn":"……嗯，我知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD2944543751FE2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1810764110:0":{"text":"ありがとう、セイン。セリスを支え、こうして俺を探し、何度も身を挺して助けてくれて……君は俺のために、十分すぎるほどのことをしてくれた。だから、もう自分を責めないでくれ。","source_cn":"谢谢你，瑟恩。培养爱丝、寻找我、一次次舍身救我……你已...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C1594582819F5A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1810764111:0":{"text":"俺は君を責めたりしない。恨むなんてもってのほかだ。\nただ今は……少し、悲しいだけだ。","source_cn":"我不会责怪你，更不会恨你。\\n只是我现在……有点悲伤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B31024BAAEEC5FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1810764112:0":{"text":"バートン……","source_cn":"巴登……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F18279B6D894431","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1810764113:0":{"text":"バンティスと戦ってきた俺たちは、グレイヴボーンはみな冷酷なモンスターだと思っていた。けれど……ばあちゃんは俺を助けるために自ら犠牲になった……","source_cn":"我们一直与班题斯为敌，总觉得亡灵全是毫无人性的怪物。可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CA52F6FD9647C8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1810764114:1":{"text":"バヤチェ先生の記憶の影響があったとはいえ……「レナード」として生きていた時も、あの人が俺に向けてくれた優しさは本物だった。","source_cn":"虽然她的确受到了巴亚茄老师记忆的影响……但在我以“里纳...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BFF534D97E019FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1810764115:1":{"text":"ばあちゃんはグレイヴボーンで、俺が人間だと知っていたのに……だから今は、もう会えないことが、すごく辛いんだ……","source_cn":"她是亡灵，也知道我是生者……而我现在，正在为她的离开而痛苦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC41E7A1CEEDAA67C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1810764116:1":{"text":"俺は……","source_cn":"我……<key:dialog858>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA388BF99B2CD5A83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1810764117:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1810764118:1":{"text":"私たちの教官の言葉を覚えているか。「誰かが倒れた時――」","source_cn":"你还记得我们教官常说的话吧？“有人倒下后——”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE097DFB081A1229","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1810764119:1":{"text":"「――私たちは、その者が歩めなかった道を歩んでいく」","source_cn":"“——我们便是他的未竟之路。”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x738768732D4174E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1810764120:1":{"text":"……だから、お前は生きるんだ。彼女の犠牲を無駄にしないためにも。","source_cn":"所以，你好好活着，就不负她的牺牲。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB16603ED2EC6E86B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1810764121:1":{"text":"……そうだな。","source_cn":"……嗯。<key:dialog808>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA83B645BB6A5DBAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1810764122:1":{"text":"そういえば、君たち二人ともノヴァリスに来て大丈夫なのか？テフラスキアの戦況は？今は誰が国境を守っているんだ？","source_cn":"对了，为什么你和爱丝都跑到诺珐斯来了？灰影郡战况如何？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECFAFF227F6BF556","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1810764123:0":{"text":"ごめんなさい。セインが出て行ったあと、私、いてもたってもいられなくなって……","source_cn":"对不起。瑟恩离开后，我实在没法安心待在灰影郡干等着。<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42AB1C2B2DC0C18E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1810764124:0":{"text":"だから……独断で領地を離れたの。でも、思いつく限りのことはやったわ。","source_cn":"所以……我就擅自离岗了。但你不用担心，我把能想到的事情...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97E237D4EA37395B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1810764125:0":{"text":"セリスはバートンに、自分が行った対策を話した。","source_cn":"爱丝特瑞达向巴登简单叙述了一遍她的安排。<key:di...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC988A36AC084E5B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1810764126:1":{"text":"偉いぞ、セリス。ずいぶん頼もしくなったな。さすがはライアン家の当主だ。","source_cn":"干得好，爱丝……你比以前稳重了很多。不愧是我们瑞恩家族...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB864BAAF3FF7CC9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1810764127:1":{"text":"でも、独断で持ち場を離れるなんて、当主失格よ。","source_cn":"巴登，我擅离职守，不配再为家主，理应受罚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E1956B82D517C18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1810764128:1":{"text":"テフラスキアに戻ったら、あなたが当主として私に処罰を下して。","source_cn":"等你回到灰影郡后，以家主的身份处置我吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C6CFB30BA04723A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1810764129:1":{"text":"いや……<style=\"highlight\">まだ、テフラスキアには戻らない</style>。","source_cn":"不，爱丝……<style=highlight>我暂时不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0652B54B260E0E7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1810764130:1":{"text":"えっ！？どういうこと？","source_cn":"那你要去哪里？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8559F8251943F8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1810764131:1":{"text":"幽声諸島の様子を見に行きたいんだ。","source_cn":"去幽声群岛，看看那里的情况。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB4A97F44A5A1F8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1810764132:1":{"text":"ばあちゃんの腕がバヤチェ先生のものだったということは、向こうの戦況は相当切迫しているはずだ……放っておくわけにはいかない。","source_cn":"